const characterSeeds=['A deadpan overachiever who secretly runs an advice column for people they pretend not to notice.','A cheerful pastry chef who talks nonstop while working but freezes when conversation turns personal.','A goth illustrator known for severe portraits who privately draws adorable animals.','A quick-tempered martial artist who is even quicker to apologize when they realize they were unfair.','A former child celebrity who wants an ordinary life but cannot stop performing for every room.','A laid-back mechanic who misses obvious social cues yet remembers every practical detail about a friend.','A reserved dancer hiding an injury that threatens the future they built their whole identity around.','A cynical reporter who assumes the worst about people and keeps finding evidence that they are better than expected.'];
